sequenceDiagram
    participant SVC as Domain Service
    participant DB as Service DB
    participant OBX as Outbox Table
    participant DBZ as Debezium CDC
    participant K as Kafka
    participant CON as Consumer
    participant RT as Retry Topic
    participant DLQ as Dead Letter Queue

    SVC->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    SVC->>DB: Write domain entity
    SVC->>OBX: INSERT outbox event
    SVC->>DB: COMMIT
    DBZ->>OBX: Poll committed rows
    DBZ->>K: Publish exactly-once
    K->>CON: Deliver event
    alt Success
        CON->>DB: Idempotent upsert
    else Transient failure
        CON->>RT: Republish with backoff
    else Poison message
        CON->>DLQ: Park after 3 attempts
        Note over DLQ: PagerDuty alert within 5 min
    end
